      "writtenOn": "2019-06-05T19:55:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"bool\" is not recognized in the current compiling setting:\ncommon//fpsensor//fpsensor.c: In function \u0027rand_finger_id\u0027:                             \ncommon//fpsensor//fpsensor.c:110:2: error: unknown type name \u0027bool\u0027; did you mean \u0027_Bool\u0027?                                                 \n  bool collision;                                                                    \n  ^~~~                                                                                   \n  _Bool",
      "parentUuid": "7d71b08a_0769711e",
      "revId": "78c707552d70f0b054337d71937d7f3636c91e3a",
